{"id":"NPC_003","n":"Baron Von Bistro","m":"MUT_011 Shark Head + MUT_219 Peacock Tail + monocle; velvet waistcoat","p":"Snooty, theatrical, secretly lonely","dst":"DST_01","at":"Le Fancy Fin, end of the Row","r":"Comedic rival restaurateur and story antagonist; runs Le Fancy Fin","d":["Your shack has charm. The charm of a damp sock.","I'll buy it for three Morph Bucks and a coupon. Final offer. Fine — two coupons.","(after Ch. 9) Hmph. Your grilled cheese is… adequate. Make me another."],"b":"[STORY] STATION at Le Fancy Fin door; struts the Row at Dusk; position is chapter-aware; ♥ fav: SEA (friendable after QST_STY_029)"}
{"id":"NPC_006","n":"Bolt Butterworth","m":"Beaver head (MUT_060 Beaver Teeth) + forklift legs + MUT_218 Beaver Tail","p":"Chipper, pun-happy, measures everything twice","dst":"DST_01","bld":"BLD_03","r":"Restaurant Supplies clerk (stations, ingredients, special stock)","d":["Need a grill? I've got grills that'll grill your grill.","Special stock's fresh today. Fresh-ish. Glowing is normal.","Dam, that's a nice kitchen. Sorry. Beaver joke. It's in my contract."],"b":"[SERVICE] STATION at counter; opens Restaurant Supplies; slaps tail on the counter at each sale; ♥ fav: BRG"}
{"id":"NPC_012","n":"Pinboard Pete","m":"MUT_004 Pigeon Head + corkboard torso covered in pinned notices","p":"Frantic, helpful, loses pins constantly","dst":"DST_01","bld":"BLD_10","r":"Job Board keeper (daily & weekly quest board, rerolls)","d":["New jobs! Hot off the board! Literally — someone pinned a pizza.","Reroll? Sure! Un-pin, re-pin… ow. Pinned myself.","Coo! Three dailies, fresh as a toast crumb."],"b":"[SERVICE] STATION at the Job Board; opens Daily/Weekly board; pecks at notices; ♥ fav: BRK"}
{"id":"NPC_028","n":"Sous-Chef Sniffles","m":"MUT_006 Rat Head + mop arm (right) + MUT_139 Plain Human Arm (left); oversized chef hat","p":"Nervous, sneezy, good-hearted underneath","dst":"DST_01","at":"alley behind Le Fancy Fin","r":"Baron's sidekick; redeemable (switches sides in Ch. 8)","d":["The Baron says I can't say your food smells good. …It smells good.","A-CHOO! Allergic to pepper. I work in a kitchen. Life is hard.","(after Ch. 8) Need a mop? I AM a mop. Partly."],"b":"[STORY] WANDER behind Le Fancy Fin; hides behind bins when the Baron yells; ♥ fav: SOP"}
{"id":"NPC_031","n":"Fizzwick Pompadour","m":"MUT_111 Flamingo Neck + MUT_125 Penguin Body + MUT_047 Mustache of Destiny","p":"Snooty maître d', sniffs at everything","dst":"DST_01","at":"Le Fancy Fin podium","r":"Rival restaurant staff: Le Fancy Fin maître d'","d":["Reservations are booked until the end of time. Try again Tuesday.","Your menu has… pictures. How quaint.","We don't serve 'fries'. We serve 'pommes de lengthwise'."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION at podium; looks down his flamingo neck at passers-by"}
{"id":"NPC_032","n":"Truffle Trufflington","m":"MUT_058 Truffle Pig Super-Snout + MUT_002 Cat Head + MUT_156 Spatula Arm","p":"Prim pastry perfectionist, privately impressed by you","dst":"DST_01","at":"Le Fancy Fin back door","r":"Rival restaurant staff: Le Fancy Fin head pastry chef","d":["I sniffed your dessert from across the street. It is… not a crime.","A soufflé is like a reputation: rises slowly, collapses instantly.","Don't tell the Baron I said 'yum'."],"b":"[QUEST] WANDER back alley; sniffs toward your plot at Dusk; ♥ fav: DES"}
{"id":"NPC_033","n":"Busboy Bix","m":"MUT_042 Bandit Raccoon Mask + MUT_204 Roller Skates + MUT_212 Dog Tail","p":"Hyper, honest to a fault, snack thief","dst":"DST_01","at":"Restaurant Row sidewalk","r":"Rival restaurant staff: Le Fancy Fin busser (sneaks your fries)","d":["Le Fancy Fin fries are cut with a laser. Yours are cut with LOVE. And a knife.","I'm on break. I'm always on break. Don't tell Fizzwick.","Wheee — coming through, carrying forty forks!"],"b":"[QUEST] PATROL the Row on skates; bonks a lamppost at Night (comedy loop); ♥ fav: FRI"}
{"id":"NPC_034","n":"Greta Griddlebottom","m":"MUT_120 Cow Body + MUT_013 Deer Head + MUT_171 Oven Mitt Hands","p":"Warm, competitive neighbor, co-op fanatic","dst":"DST_01","at":"'Dog Days' cart on the Row","r":"Street-food neighbor; co-op cooking champion","d":["Neighbor! Borrow a cup of ketchup? I'll trade a cup of mustard.","Cooking's better with friends. And worse with the Baron.","My cart has one wheel and a dream."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION at cart; serves pretend hot dogs to crowd NPCs; ♥ fav: SAN"}
{"id":"NPC_035","n":"Gus the Plot Surveyor","m":"MUT_015 Giraffe Head + MUT_110 Giraffe Neck + MUT_187 Robot Leg ×2 (tripod stance)","p":"Precise, geometry-obsessed, deadpan","dst":"DST_01","bld":"BLD_17","at":"between plots","r":"City plot surveyor; measures façades for tier upgrades","d":["Your façade is 0.3 studs off-center. I've lost sleep.","A circle is just a square that gave up.","Upgrade approved. Structurally. Emotionally, I have concerns."],"b":"[QUEST] WANDER between plots with a theodolite; measures players who stand still"}
{"id":"NPC_036","n":"Spork","m":"MUT_185 Spider Leg Cluster ×2 + toolbox-shaped MUT_022 Robot Head + MUT_173 Whisk Fingers","p":"Eager apprentice, overcommits to everything","dst":"DST_01","bld":"BLD_03","r":"Restaurant Supplies assistant (deliveries, repair tips)","d":["Boss says I'm half spoon, half fork, all enthusiasm!","I can carry six crates! …Five. Four. Help.","Broken table? Tap it gently. With love. And a hammer."],"b":"[QUEST] WANDER aisles stacking crates; drops one every 5 min (comedy SFX)"}
{"id":"NPC_037","n":"Tackatha","m":"MUT_063 Toucan Beak + MUT_085 Bunny Ears + MUT_232 Butterfly Wings","p":"Bubbly, gossip-adjacent, speed-reader","dst":"DST_01","bld":"BLD_10","r":"Job Board assistant; Pete's niece (posts dailies)","d":["Uncle Pete pinned himself again. I've got the board!","Fresh daily! Smells like burgers and ambition.","Tip: happy customers tip. Unhappy customers throw. Choose wisely!"],"b":"[QUEST] STATION beside the board; pins new posters at 00:00 UTC with a fanfare; ♥ fav: DRK"}
{"id":"NPC_038","n":"Lumpy the Line-Waiter","m":"MUT_001 Bear Head + MUT_259 Bear Fur + MUT_198 Rocket Booster Leg ×2 (never used)","p":"Sleepy, philosophical professional queue-stander","dst":"DST_01","at":"outside the busiest restaurant on the server","r":"Professional line-waiter","d":["I've waited in every line in Morph City. Yours is… adequate.","Rocket legs. Never used 'em. Waiting is an art.","Zzz… is it my turn? No? Perfect."],"b":"[AMBIENT] SIT on the sidewalk outside the busiest plot (street only, never a customer, never blocks the door)"}
