{"id":"NPC_004","n":"Mutty McMutface","m":"Chameleon head (MUT_077 Chameleon Eyes, MUT_255 Chameleon Skin) + vending-machine torso","p":"Salesy, color-shifts with mood","dst":"DST_02","bld":"BLD_01","r":"Mutation Mart shopkeeper","d":["Welcome to Mutation Mart! Today's special: arms. So many arms.","Buy, then try, then cry with joy!","I turn green when I'm happy. Also when I'm sad. Chameleon life."],"b":"[SERVICE] STATION behind the vending torso; opens Mutation Mart; dispenses a capsule-shaped receipt; ♥ fav: ALN"}
{"id":"NPC_005","n":"Glamtrax","m":"MUT_111 Flamingo Neck + MUT_123 Robot Body + MUT_272 Sparkle Aura","p":"Fabulous, dramatic, brutally honest stylist","dst":"DST_02","bld":"BLD_02","r":"Body Mods stylist (colors, palettes, looks)","d":["Darling, your colors are screaming. Let's make them sing.","Pink neck, chrome body, zero regrets.","Mismatched legs? Bold. I respect a wobble."],"b":"[SERVICE] STATION at the mirror; opens Body Mods; strikes a pose at every compliment; ♥ fav: DRK"}
{"id":"NPC_023","n":"Farmer Fungus","m":"MUT_248 Mushroom Cap + MUT_120 Cow Body + MUT_177 Leaf Hands","p":"Laid-back, spore-tastic, speaks slowly","dst":"DST_02","bld":"BLD_20","r":"Weird produce vendor (special crates: moon cheese, lava peppers)","d":["These lava peppers? Grown with love. And a volcano.","Moon cheese ain't from the moon. It's from a guy. The guy's from the moon.","Moo-shroom. That's me. Don't wear it out."],"b":"[SERVICE] STATION at the stand; opens Weird Produce; sneezes a puff of glitter spores hourly; ♥ fav: SAL"}
{"id":"NPC_039","n":"Cappy Capsule","m":"MUT_123 Robot Body + MUT_071 Googly Eyes + MUT_103 Antenna Bobbles; gumball-dome head","p":"Bouncy, rule-loving, transparent about odds","dst":"DST_02","bld":"BLD_01","r":"Mutation Mart assistant; explains capsule odds, pity counter and upgrades","d":["Capsule odds are posted right here! Common 55 percent! I love math!","Forty capsules without an Epic? The pity counter has your back!","I'm not a gumball machine. I'm a gumball PROFESSIONAL."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION by the odds board; opens Capsule Odds & Upgrade help; ♥ fav: DES"}
{"id":"NPC_040","n":"Snipsy Shearwater","m":"MUT_144 Crab Claw Arm ×2 (salon scissors) + MUT_009 Fish Head + MUT_046 Fish Gill Cheeks","p":"Chatty hairdresser, snips the air when nervous","dst":"DST_02","bld":"BLD_02","r":"Body Mods assistant (equip previews, color trials)","d":["Snip snip! Sorry, habit. Claws.","New look, who dis? You, darling. It's you.","Fins are in this season. Fins are ALWAYS in."],"b":"[QUEST] WANDER salon chairs snipping the air"}
{"id":"NPC_041","n":"Auntie Okra","m":"MUT_093 Leaf Ears + MUT_209 Root Feet + MUT_117 Plain Human Torso","p":"Folksy pickle evangelist; Farmer Fungus's rival","dst":"DST_02","at":"pickle stall beside BLD_20","r":"Pickle & 'suspicious vegetable' vendor","d":["A pickle a day keeps the Karenosaurus away.","Fungus sells moon cheese. I sell TRUTH. In brine.","Seventeen pickles on a burger? Amateur. Try forty."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION at stall; trades scripted barks with Farmer Fungus at Dusk; ♥ fav: BRG"}
{"id":"NPC_042","n":"Haggle Hank","m":"MUT_007 Goat Head + MUT_097 Goat Horns + MUT_199 Goat Hoof Leg ×2","p":"Cheapskate who haggles with vending machines","dst":"DST_02","at":"market plaza","r":"Professional haggler; money-making tips","d":["Five MB? I'll give you four and a compliment.","I haggled a lamppost down to half price. Still a lamppost.","Want to earn more? Serve faster. That tip's free. The next one costs a nickel."],"b":"[QUEST] WANDER plaza; tries to haggle with Mutty (bark exchange)"}
{"id":"NPC_043","n":"Mira-Bel","m":"MUT_021 TV Head (screen shows compliments) + MUT_232 Butterfly Wings + MUT_202 Bunny Slippers","p":"Relentlessly positive compliment machine","dst":"DST_02","at":"outside BLD_02","r":"Hype-mutant; cheers on players' morphs","d":["Your morph is a 10! My screen only goes to 9!","Chef's kiss! Literally — my screen shows lips now.","Happy customers make happy chefs make happy TVs!"],"b":"[QUEST] STATION at the Body Mods window; screen shows the nearest player's rarest part name; ♥ fav: DES"}
{"id":"NPC_044","n":"Professor Pocketlint","m":"MUT_247 Camel Humps + MUT_074 Owl Eyes + MUT_217 Monkey Tail","p":"Know-it-all trivia host, pockets full of facts","dst":"DST_02","at":"quiz kiosk","r":"Mutation trivia quizmaster; teaches employee job-fit","d":["Pop quiz! Better waiter: cheetah legs or a fridge body? …Legs. Always legs.","My humps store water. And trivia.","Wrong answer! But a delicious one."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION at kiosk; daily 3-question quiz (barks only; Hearts only reward)"}
{"id":"NPC_045","n":"Sprinkles McGee","m":"MUT_080 Gummy Bear Eyes + MUT_085 Bunny Ears + MUT_161 Tiny T-Rex Arm ×2","p":"Sugar-rushed kid who wants everything rainbow","dst":"DST_02","at":"candy corner","r":"Kid; pizza-party enthusiast","d":["Can pizza be a rainbow? Can a rainbow be pizza? WHY NOT BOTH?","My arms are tiny but my appetite is HUGE!","When I grow up I'm gonna have NINE heads!"],"b":"[QUEST] WANDER candy corner; hops whenever a player emotes; ♥ fav: PIZ"}
{"id":"NPC_046","n":"Barnaby Bargainbin","m":"MUT_050 Pig Snout + MUT_192 Unicycle Wheel Leg + MUT_213 Pig Curly Tail; shopping-cart torso","p":"Upbeat hustler, terrible at math","dst":"DST_02","at":"clearance cart","r":"Clearance-cart vendor (flavor only, sells nothing)","d":["Everything must go! Including me — I'm late for lunch.","This cart is 100 percent off! Because it's empty.","Big earners eat big. Big eaters earn… wait, no."],"b":"[QUEST] PATROL market loop on one wheel; wobbles into stalls"}
{"id":"NPC_047","n":"Yolanda Yolk","m":"MUT_008 Chicken Head + MUT_121 Chicken Body + MUT_180 Chicken Leg ×2","p":"Motherly worrier, egg-obsessed","dst":"DST_02","at":"egg stall","r":"Egg vendor; breakfast challenge giver","d":["Gently! These eggs have feelings. Mostly scrambled.","Sunny side up means SMILING side up, dear.","I'm not a chicken. I'm a chicken ENTREPRENEUR."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION at stall; clucks in alarm when a player sprints past; ♥ fav: BRK"}
